    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math intriguing but not my strongest subject. My upper secondary education covered basics, and I’ve since focused on practical applications through hobbies like cycling and hiking, where I estimate distances and patterns. I see math as a tool for problem-solving, not a rigid discipline.",
